    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποσάκῐς</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποσσάκιν</span></b>  (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁππόσσακιν</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			30.27
		</span></i>:— Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>as many times
				as . . ,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.3.23
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποσάκις ἄν</span>”
				<i>so often as ever,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					197d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποσακισοῦν</span>”
				<i>as many times as you please,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					273a32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
